<title>HONG KONG: HK Telecom falls on news of CITIC sale.</title>
<headline>HK Telecom falls on news of CITIC sale.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd shares fell HK$0.25 to HK$14.75 after trading resumed following a half day suspension on Friday pending an announcement that CITIC Pacific Ltd had sold a 7.74 percent stake in HK Telecom for HK$11.4 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
